# access.map: the source of truth for who can decrypt what.
#
# Groups first: @name = repo__context identities. Contexts are actions,
# agents, codespaces, and dependabot. Then one line per file:
#   <logical path under src/, no .sops>: <@groups and/or identities>
# There is no inheritance. List every group or identity that should be able
# to decrypt each file. After any change: make build, then commit.
#
# Example:
#   @oss        = site__actions docs__actions
#   @commercial = app__actions app__agents
#
#   oss.env:        @oss @commercial
#   commercial.env: @commercial
#   ios/AuthKey_ABC123.p8: app__actions
